"Tutorials and trials already take place inside the Labyrinth, unknown to most."
"A dead zone cuts the Labyrinth off from the rest of System space."
"A demigod Gatekeeper guards the few crossings through the dead zone."
"The Labyrinth is an embryo of the abyss, seeking to let eldritch beings devour reality."
"Worlds that fail Taltos's challenge are recycled into new conduits."
"The demigod Preservation plots in secret to end the Labyrinth."
"The Tower of Rizzen sits in a plane between planes, rooted in hundreds of worlds."
"The Cinder Isle is a System-curated world in a minor node of the Labyrinth's fringe."
